      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(memory): skip blank search provider bootstrap",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nMemory search handled blank or whitespace-only queries too late. The manager could initialize the provider, assert provider state, or bootstrap search work before the preflight returned an empty result.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nBlank query eligibility is a local preflight contract and should not require provider setup. This change shares query normalization with the existing preflight and short-circuits blank queries before provider/bootstrap work.\n\n## User Impact\n\nWhitespace-only memory searches return `[]` cheaply and deterministically, without requiring provider credentials, indexes, or search startup.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Changed `extensions/memory-core/src/memory/manager.ts`.\n- Changed `extensions/memory-core/src/memory/manager-search-preflight.ts`.\n- Added `extensions/memory-core/src/memory/manager.blank-query.test.ts` proving blank search returns `[]` before provider init, provider assertion, index check, or sync bootstrap.\n- `OPENCLAW_HEAVY_CHECK_LOCK_SCOPE=worktree node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run --config test/vitest/vitest.extension-memory.config.ts extensions/memory-core/src/memory/manager-search-preflight.test.ts extensions/memory-core/src/memory/manager.blank-query.test.ts --reporter=verbose`\n- `git diff --check upstream/main..HEAD`\n- Controlled manager proof: `node --import tsx - <<'EOF' ...` invoked the actual `MemoryIndexManager.search` method with a whitespace-only query and provider/bootstrap counters.\n\n## Proof\n\n- Controlled proof query: whitespace-only.\n- Controlled proof result: `resultCount: 0`, `results: []`.\n- Provider/bootstrap counters all stayed zero: `ensureProviderInitialized: 0`, `assertRequiredProviderAvailable: 0`, `hasIndexedContent: 0`, `sync: 0`.\n- This proves the blank-query preflight returns before provider initialization, provider availability assertion, index checks, or sync bootstrap.\n",
        "branch": "llagy007/memory-blank-query-preflight",
        "head_sha": "d38167df24b330623b9e64a55e7726975aa1d05a",
        "author": "llagy007",
